  "notes": "Three pages: the ACORD 25 (2016/03) on page 1, ISO CG 20 37 04 13 (additional insured, products-completed operations) on page 2 and the carrier's own WC 99 04 10 C (Ed. 01-19) waiver of subrogation on page 3 — the 'WC 99 04 10 variant' this fixture exists for (KB §C.3: the ISO-shaped number is a carrier form, not an ISO form, and the accepts list has to hold both shapes). The description of operations names no form numbers at all, so both mentions come from the attached pages. ADDL INSD prints the letter Y on the general-liability row; SUBR WVD prints Y on the workers' compensation row only. The authorised-representative box carries an ink signature that no reader could resolve into a name, so no name is recorded. A line under the form footer reads 'THIS CERTIFICATE SUPERSEDES PREVIOUSLY ISSUED CERTIFICATE'.",
